Z||000005||FieroMaster88||11-18-2001||01:10 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mach10:<BR><B> See?!? SEE WHAT HAPPENS?!?! That's what happens when you aren't allowed to spank your children. That child deserves to be flogged like a red-headed step-son &gt;:<P>GIT BACK IN YER CELL, OR I'LL BRING OUT THE HOSE! </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's <B>EXACTLY</B> what I think is wrong with some kids today.  There are no rules or consequences.  I am still a kid myself.  I am 20, getting closer to 21.  I was spanked if I was out of line when I was a kid.  I learned real quick what was expected behavior from me.  Kids today don't get that.  I see people with their kids in the store who just keep saying "stop it" but don't do anything else.  I even saw a kid the other day that THREATENED his mother, and she said nothing.  If that would have been me when I was a child my mom would have swathed my arse...and when I got home I would have had my mouth washed out with soap and probably had no TV for weeks.  When there is no punishment for bad behavior the behavior will only get worse, and that makes everyone suffer..... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                   <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
