Z||000022||Mach10||11-18-2001||07:55 PM||||just finished chasing off a pile of the little brass-studs from the local mcdonalds &gt;:\<P>the little shites were hucking stones at the glass parts. the manager had chased 'em off twice while i was waiting for my order. i sauntered up to the largest, and told him to beat it.<BR>he asked me what i was going to do about it.<BR>i told him that i hadn't actually though of that, 'cos I didn't figure on him being stupid enough to hang around to find out.<BR>at that, i fixed a level, gaze at him and told him again to take a hike. i suspect they returned after i left, but they sure went away in a hurry. hehehe... the manager (bit of a cute one  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) was watching. she was happy to be rid of 'em. got me a free bigmac  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>honestly, the only thing these kids need is some sort of idea of consequences. i didn't threaten 'em... their imaginations can do that for 'em. all i had to do was stand there. don't back down. but remember that they *are* still kids. just give 'em a good reason to piss off||||reg||6
